WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.690
Faster can describe a horse, or it can describe how the horse runs.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.800
When it describes a thing, it’s an adjective.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.280
When it tells how someone did something, it’s an adverb.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.560
So don’t just spot the comparing words.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.800
Ask what each one is describing.
